      "statement": "| T-013 | Native check in the Claude desktop app on Windows 11 with screenshots and measured refresh time as UAT input: current project, disposable legacy store, live events during a short run | Arndt Gold | T-012 |",
      "intended_change": "| T-013 | Native check in the Claude desktop app on Windows 11 with screenshots and measured refresh time as UAT input: current project, disposable legacy store, live events during a short run | Arndt Gold | T-012 |\n| T-014 | Host load regression after the T-013 finding F1: the companion uses every `$` noun only at its call site (the run-view reader receives a call-site wrapper of `$.process.run`), the adapter test rejects a `$` noun used as a value, the integrity test names the exact process call sites, and `claude plugin validate` passes on the generated plugin | Arndt Gold | T-013 |\n| T-015 | Event and notice texts after the owner request of 2026-11-06: pane lines and toasts of the shown run name no run, those of another run name its objective or a short id (`events.ofRun`), notice toasts name no run; catalog, companion tests, generated assets and the compatibility record follow | Arndt Gold | T-013 |",
      "reason": "Native check T-013 findings F1, F2 and F5; owner decision of 2026-11-07 to cover them through a TP source revision."
    },
    {
