      "intended_change": "| AC-005 | SCN-011 | `npm --prefix packages/cli run test:claude-companion` | local Windows 11 workstation | fake `$` with injected clock, file access and process | Claude agent, accountable Arndt Gold | adapter assertions and call counts pass | stop, fix, re-run |\n| AC-005 | SCN-024 | `npm --prefix packages/cli run test:claude-companion` | local Windows 11 workstation | fake `$` with an event of the shown run and one of another run | Claude agent, accountable Arndt Gold | text and toast assertions pass in de and en | stop, fix, re-run |",
